{
  "id": 7925367144688,
  "title": "Aquapolis Booster Pack",
  "handle": "aquapolis-unlimited-short-crimp",
  "description": "<p>Booster packs are offered in three variants: Heavy, Light, and Unsearched.</p><p><strong>Heavy:</strong> Expected to contain a holographic card or better. Heavy packs are guaranteed or covered by holo insurance, as outlined in our <a href=\"https://loosepacks.com/pages/heavy-pack-policy\">Heavy Pack Policy</a>.</p><p><strong>Light:</strong> Unlikely to contain a holographic card.</p><p><strong>Unsearched:</strong> Not weighed or sorted by us, offering a random chance at pulling a holographic card.</p><p><strong>Our Approach:</strong> Some packs are straightforward to evaluate, allowing us to confidently offer Heavy or Light designations backed by our guarantee. However, certain sets are much more nuanced and difficult to classify with precision. In those cases, we choose not to assign a category to avoid any potential misclassification. This ensures accuracy and a better overall experience.</p><p>Packs are labeled in the dropdown menu. Any pack without a specific category in its title should be considered unsearched.</p>\n<p><strong>Stock photo displayed.</strong> Please email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@loosepacks.com\">info@loosepacks.com</a> for exact photos of this product.</p>",
